    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just sounds like a way to cope with failure. \"finding a path\" and \"going with the flow\" is just what people say when they've given up on excellence. i don't want a \"natural extension\" of being mediocre. if you know you're never going to be at the top, what's even the point of continuing the charade? why keep going through the motions of a life that has no real impact or meaning?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
